d this software, NOT survey microdata placed into an archive built with
d it -- that belongs to the producers who collected it. Full text and
d notices: https://github.com/jpazvd/datalib (LICENSE, NOTICE).
d
d Authors: Joao Pedro Azevedo (UNICEF), Minh Cong Nguyen (World Bank)
d Support: jpazevedo@unicef.org
d
